pseudo-Boolean proof version 2.0
* Positive companion to incorrect/version2/strengthening_to_core_bare_red_derived: the second
* witness touches a different variable, so the obligation the first `red` now leaves behind is
* dischargeable and the proof must still verify.
f 1
strengthening_to_core on
red 1 y1 >= 1 ; y1 -> 1
red 1 y2 >= 1 ; y2 -> 1
output NONE
conclusion NONE
end pseudo-Boolean proof
